    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoop Fighters</strong> is a multiplayer and <strong>rule-free party basketball game</strong> with cartoon graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can beat up your friends or other players while making scores in lobbies which you can create up to 6 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.poster.avif?t=1754929307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.webm?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.mp4?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can punch, slide or even throw objects around your opponent to get the ball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to run to the ball again after scoring because <strong><i>the game never stops!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.poster.avif?t=1754929307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.webm?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.mp4?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take your place in the most unregulated and funny basketball game to show off your basketball skills, have unlimited fun and beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.poster.avif?t=1754929307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.webm?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.mp4?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character that reflects your mood best and jump onto the court.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoop Fighters</strong> is a multiplayer and <strong>rule-free party basketball game</strong> with cartoon graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can beat up your friends or other players while making scores in lobbies which you can create up to 6 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.poster.avif?t=1754929307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.webm?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.mp4?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can punch, slide or even throw objects around your opponent to get the ball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to run to the ball again after scoring because <strong><i>the game never stops!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.poster.avif?t=1754929307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.webm?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.mp4?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take your place in the most unregulated and funny basketball game to show off your basketball skills, have unlimited fun and beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.poster.avif?t=1754929307\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.webm?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.mp4?t=1754929307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character that reflects your mood best and jump onto the court.</p>",
    "short_description": "Knock down your opponents and smash their hoops! Hoop Fighters is an online, no-rules party basketball game for up to 6 players. Slide into opponents, throw punches or objects at them. Do your best to get the ball. Remember, there are no rules in Hoop Fighters!",
